# Build-time site origins.
#
# The two sites link to each other by absolute URL, so a build needs both
# origins. These values are read from the process environment; nothing loads
# this file automatically, so export them in your shell or in the command line
# that runs the build. Copy the pair below for a local build, or point both at
# the hosts you serve from.
#
# Rules: http(s) scheme, host and optional port only, no path, query, fragment
# or credentials, and the two values must differ.

WEBSITE_ORIGIN=http://localhost:4173
DOCS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:4174
